    "Name": "Cascatelle",
    "Details": "This dedicated fire support platform may be the most successful Thunderbolt Missile delivery system to date. First spotted in 3121, it uses paired AMS-resistant LRM launchers to occupy enemy missile defenses, effectively neutralizing the primary drawback of single-missile systems and paving the way for massive Thunderbolt 20 warheads.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar biomes.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 6/9 hexes / 180/270 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       250     30\n<b>Left</b>         180     30\n<b>Right</b>       180     30\n<b>Rear</b>        145     30\n\n<b>Total</b>      780    150</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Integrated Searchlight</color>",
